{"root":"tuduh","ipa":"/tu.duh/","core":"指责、控告，通常指在没有确凿证据的情况下断定某人有罪或有过错。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tu.duh/","zh":"指责，控告","phrases":[{"t":"tuduh menuduh","zh":"互相指责"},{"t":"tuduhan palsu","zh":"虚假指控"},{"t":"tuduh tanpa bukti","zh":"无端指责"}],"examples":[{"t":"Jangan menuduh orang lain tanpa bukti yang kuat.","zh":"不要在没有确凿证据的情况下指责他人。"},{"t":"Dia dituduh mencuri uang perusahaan.","zh":"他被指控偷窃公司钱财。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tuduh","ipa":"/tu.duh/","zh":"指责（原型词）","phrase":{"t":"tuduh langsung","zh":"直接指责"},"example":{"t":"Dia tuduh saya berbohong.","zh":"他指责我撒谎。"}},{"w":"menuduh","ipa":"/mə.nu.duh/","zh":"指控，控告","phrase":{"t":"menuduh secara sepihak","zh":"单方面指控"},"example":{"t":"Polisi menuduh dia sebagai pelaku utama.","zh":"警方指控他是主犯。"}},{"w":"menuduhkan","ipa":"/mə.nu.duh.kan/","zh":"将某事归咎于某人","phrase":{"t":"menuduhkan kesalahan","zh":"归咎过错"},"example":{"t":"Mereka menuduhkan kegagalan itu kepada saya.","zh":"他们把那次失败归咎于我。"}},{"w":"tuduhan","ipa":"/tu.du.han/","zh":"指控，控告（名词）","phrase":{"t":"tuduhan berat","zh":"严重指控"},"example":{"t":"Tuduhan itu tidak berdasar.","zh":"那项指控毫无根据。"}},{"w":"tertuduh","ipa":"/tər.tu.duh/","zh":"被指控者，被告","phrase":{"t":"tertuduh utama","zh":"主要被告"},"example":{"t":"Tertuduh dibawa ke pengadilan hari ini.","zh":"被告今天被带到了法庭。"}},{"w":"penuduh","ipa":"/pə.nu.duh/","zh":"指控者，原告","phrase":{"t":"penuduh utama","zh":"主要指控者"},"example":{"t":"Penuduh harus memberikan bukti di depan hakim.","zh":"指控者必须在法官面前提供证据。"}}],"derSlugs":["tuduh","menuduh","menuduhkan","tuduhan","tertuduh","penuduh"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:01:40.530Z","src":"base"}